---
source: crates/domain/oxikube_domain/tests/redact.rs
expression: listing
---
pem-private-key
  PEM private key blocks
  (?s)-----BEGIN [A-Z0-9 ]*PRIVATE KEY-----.*?(?:-----END [A-Z0-9 ]*PRIVATE KEY-----|\z)

authorization-header
  *authorization values (Authorization, Proxy-Authorization, proxy_authorization): any scheme, quoted, bracketed or comma-separated parameter forms
  (?i)(?P<key>\b[\w-]*authorization)(?P<sep>(?:\\?["'])?[ \t]*[:=][ \t]*(?:some\(\s*)?)(?P<val>\[[^\]]*\]|[A-Za-z][\w-]*[ \t]+(?:\[redacted\]|(?:(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*")(?:=(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*")|\\.|[^\s,}\])"'\\]|["'][^\s,}\])"'\\])*|(?:=(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*")|\\.|[^\s,}\])"'\\]|["'][^\s,}\])"'\\])+))(?:,[ \t]*(?:(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*")(?:=(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*")|\\.|[^\s,}\])"'\\]|["'][^\s,}\])"'\\])*|(?:=(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*")|\\.|[^\s,}\])"'\\]|["'][^\s,}\])"'\\])+))*|(?:\[redacted\]|\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*"|'[^']*'|[A-Za-z_]\w*\(\[[0-9, \t]*\]\)|\[[0-9][0-9, \t]*\]|\{(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*"|[^{}])*\}|(?P<bare>(?:\\.|[^\s"'\\]|["'][^\s,;}\])"'\\])+)))

secret-field
  *token, *password, *passwd, *secret, *apikey / *api_key / *api-key, client-key-data, client-certificate-data, secret-data / string-data values (a data key's inline map is left to secret-data-flow)
  (?i)(?P<key>\b[\w-]*(?:token|password|passwd|secret|api[-_]?key)\b|\bclient[-_](?:key|certificate)[-_]data\b|\b(?:secret|string)[-_]?data\b)(?P<sep>(?:\\?["'])?[ \t]*[:=][ \t]*(?:some\(\s*)?)(?P<val>(?:\[redacted\]|\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*"|'[^']*'|[A-Za-z_]\w*\(\[[0-9, \t]*\]\)|\[[0-9][0-9, \t]*\]|\{(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*"|[^{}])*\}|(?P<bare>(?:\\.|[^\s"'\\]|["'][^\s,;}\])"'\\])+)))

url-userinfo
  the password in scheme://user:password@host URLs (proxy URLs)
  (?P<pre>\b[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9+.-]*://[^\s/:@"'\\]*:)(?P<pw>[^\s/"'\\]+)@

scheme-credential
  `Bearer <token>` / `Basic <credentials>` anywhere in text (a plain word such as `basic auth` or `bearer of` is kept)
  (?i)\b(?:bearer|basic)[ \t]+(?P<tok>[A-Za-z0-9._~+/=-]+)

jwt
  JWT-shaped strings: eyJ header, payload, signature
  eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,}\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,}\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]*

secret-data-flow
  values inside an inline data / stringData / secret_data map; each entry matched by secret-data-pair
  (?i)(?P<key>\b(?:(?:secret|string)[-_]?)?data)(?P<sep>(?:\\?["'])?[ \t]*[:=][ \t]*(?:some\(\s*)?)(?P<open>(?:\\?["'])?\{)(?P<body>(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*"|[^{}])*)\}

secret-data-pair
  one key/value entry of a data map
  (?P<k>\\?"[^"\\]*\\?"|[\w.-]+)(?P<s>[ \t]*[:=][ \t]*)(?P<val>(?:\[redacted\]|\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*"|'[^']*'|[A-Za-z_]\w*\(\[[0-9, \t]*\]\)|\[[0-9][0-9, \t]*\]|\{(?:\\"(?:[^"\\]|\\\\\\"|\\[^"])*\\"|"(?:[^"\\]|\\.)*"|[^{}])*\}|(?P<bare>(?:\\.|[^\s"'\\]|["'][^\s,;}\])"'\\])+)))

secret-data-block
  entries indented under a multi-line data / stringData header line; lines end at real newlines and at escaped `\n` (hand-written scanner; header regex shown, entries use secret-data-pair)
  (?i)(?:^|[^\w.-])\\?"?(?:(?:secret|string)[-_]?)?data\\?"?[ \t]*:[ \t]*\{?[ \t]*\r?$

sensitive field names: ["client-key-data", "client_key_data", "client-certificate-data", "client_certificate_data", "client-secret", "client_secret", "secret-data", "secret_data", "string-data", "string_data", "stringdata"]
sensitive field suffixes: ["token", "password", "passwd", "authorization", "secret", "apikey", "api_key", "api-key"]
